{"product_id":"vladdin-nic-salt-honeydew-ice","title":"Vladdin Nic Salt - Honeydew Ice","description":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHoneydew Ice:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Cool off with the icy sweetness of Honeydew Ice. This refreshing flavor combines the juicy sweetness of ripe honeydew melon with a hint of menthol, offering a crisp and invigorating vaping experience. Each inhale is like biting into a chilled slice of honeydew, with its coolness enveloping your palate and leaving you feeling utterly satisfied. It's the perfect choice for vapers seeking a refreshing vape experience that's both sweet and cooling.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 30mg \u0026amp; 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30ml Chubby Gorilla Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vladdin","offers":[{"title":"30mg","offer_id":41774706229303,"sku":"Vladdin Honeydew Ice 30 mg","price":1490.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41774706262071,"sku":"Vladdin Honeydew Ice 50 mg","price":1490.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Vladdin-Honeydew-Ice-Nic-Salt-30ml-min.jpg?v=1752483995","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vladdin-nic-salt-honeydew-ice","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




